title: mf repo check
tags: [[CLI command]] Storage
kind: reference
summary: Check that the selected repository's indexes agree with its data

Prints `ok` on a healthy store. Otherwise prints one problem per line and exits 1:
either an index that disagrees with the data (repaired by `mf repo reindex`), or a
metarecord holding several positions in one forest (repaired by setting the field
to one value — `reindex` does not touch it). Changes nothing
([[Checking and reindexing a repository]]).
